@startuml wal-record
' ============================================================================
' wal-record.puml — the 17-byte WAL record frame + the 15 record types.
' Source of truth: src/persistent_artrie/core/wal/codec.rs
'   (RECORD_HEADER_SIZE = 17; WalRecordType, 15 discriminants).
' Replaces the no-viewBox svgbob SVG with a compact, colored, viewBox'd byte-field.
' Color key: purple integrity (CRC) · amber length · orange LSN (WAL) ·
'            teal type · blue payload
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #37474F
  FontColor #212121
  BorderThickness 1.2
}
skinparam noteFontSize 13
skinparam TitleFontSize 15

title WAL record — 17-byte header + type-specific payload

rectangle "bytes **0..3**    crc32  (over length · lsn · type · payload)" as R0 #E1BEE7
rectangle "bytes **4..7**    length  (payload byte count)" as R1 #FFE0B2
rectangle "bytes **8..15**    lsn  (u64 log-sequence number)" as R2 #FFCC80
rectangle "byte  **16**    type  (1 of 15 WalRecordType)" as R3 #B2DFDB
rectangle "bytes **17..**    payload  (type-specific)" as R4 #BBDEFB

R0 -[hidden]down- R1
R1 -[hidden]down- R2
R2 -[hidden]down- R3
R3 -[hidden]down- R4

note bottom of R4
  **15 WalRecordType discriminants**
  1 Insert · 2 Remove · 3 Checkpoint · 4 BeginTx · 5 CommitTx
  6 AbortTx · 7 Increment · 8 Upsert · 9 CompareAndSwap
  10 BatchInsert · 11 BatchIncrement · 12 VersionUpdate
  13 VersionDurable · 14 VersionGc · 15 CommitRank
end note

legend bottom
  purple CRC integrity · amber length · orange LSN · teal type · blue payload
endlegend
@enduml
